        "content": "<p>I don't understand the QuantumInfo file system very well, but I was wondering if something like the following file structure would work better</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">└──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">QuantumInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">States</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Qubit</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Braket</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mixed</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MState</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fidelity</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">└──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TraceDistance</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Ensemble</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">│</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"bp\">└──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FreeState</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">└──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Channels</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CPTP</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bundled</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Dual</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MatrixMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unbundled</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">├──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Capacity</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"bp\">└──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DegradableOrder</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>(Tree editable <a href=\"https://tree.nathanfriend.com/?s=(%27options!(%27fAcy6~fullPath!false~trailingSlash6~rootDot6)~9(%279%27QuAtumInfo%2047s4%20*Qubit8Braket8Mixed*2M7582FidelityH2TraceDistAceHEnsembG8Free734ChAnels*CPTP5HBundGd8Dual8MatrixMap8UnbundGdHCapacity8DegradabGOrder344*%27)~version!%271%27)*4203%202%20%203.GA4%5Cn250-%3E%20Basic6!true7State80*9source!AanGleH3*%01HGA987654320*\">here</a>  - I haven't included all the files)</p>",
